"Keys of voices are small black enchanted discs the Informant has made over eight decades."
"The first sits in the fountain of his square near Sanjiao Beach; hundreds more hide in its houses."
"Pressing the fountain, his skill activates every key at once to whisper live talk anywhere, by keyword."
"Other types exist, such as keys of eyes; Avowed who join keys to the apparatus make it stronger."
"The Triplanets want to buy the network; he will only negotiate its use and protection."
